<!-- privacy.html -->
<!Doctype html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Privacy Policy — Pickker.pk</title>
    <link rel="shortcut icon" href="/Imgs/logo.png" type="image/x-icon">
    <style>
        :root {
            --green: #0a7a3f;
            --dark: #083d25;
            --muted: #6b7280;
            --max: 900px
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box
        }

        body {
            font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Noto Nastaliq Urdu', sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            background: #f7faf7;
            color: #0f1724
        }

        .container {
            max-width: var(--max);
            margin: 32px auto;
            padding: 24px;
            background: #fff;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(2, 6, 23, 0.06)
        }

        header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px
        }

        .logo {
            width: 54px;
            height: 54px;
            border-radius: 40px;
            background-image: url(logo.png);
            background-size: cover;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: #fff;
            font-weight: 700
        }

        h1 {
            margin: 8px 0 12px;
            font-size: 20px
        }

        p {
            color: var(--muted);
            line-height: 1.6
        }

        h2 {
            color: var(--dark);
            margin-top: 20px
        }

        footer {
            margin-top: 28px;
            padding-top: 18px;
            border-top: 1px solid #eef2f7;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center
        }

        a.btn {
            background: var(--green);
            color: #fff;
            padding: 8px 12px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            text-decoration: none
        }

        .muted {
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 13px
        }

        @media (max-width:600px) {
            .container {
                margin: 12px;
                padding: 16px
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="container">
        <header>
            <div class="logo"></div>
            <div>
                <strong>Pickker.pk</strong>
                <div class="muted">Pakistan ka apna marketplace</div>
            </div>
        </header>

        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p><strong>Date: </strong>30/9/2025</p>

        <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Account information: name, email, phone number.</li>
            <li>Listings: photos, descriptions, price and location.</li>
            <li>Verification data: CNIC images, selfies (where uploaded).</li>
            <li>Technical: IP, device info, cookies, usage logs.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>2. Use of Information</h2>
        <p>We use data to provide services, verify identity, improve safety and personalize user experience.</p>

        <h2>3. CNIC &amp; Sensitive Data</h2>
        <p>CNIC files are stored encrypted and accessed only by authorized verification admins. We retain CNIC files for
            90 days after verification unless the user requests deletion earlier.</p>

        <h2>4. Sharing &amp; Third Parties</h2>
        <p>We do not sell your personal data. We share data only with service providers (hosting, storage), legal
            authorities where required, and under confidentiality agreements.</p>

        <h2>5. Cookies</h2>
        <p>We use cookies for session management, analytics and UX personalization. You can control cookies via browser
            settings.</p>

        <h2>6. Your Rights</h2>
        <p>You may request access, correction, or deletion of your data. Deleting CNIC data will remove verification
            badges.</p>

        <h2>7. Security</h2>
        <p>We use HTTPS and encryption at rest. Access to sensitive files is logged and restricted.</p>

        <footer>
            <div class="muted">Contact: privacy@Pickker.pk</div>
        </footer>
    </div>
</body>

</html>